    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Blightened</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the corruption when the cycle begins! Blight is both your weapon and your curse. Wield unstable <strong><i>blight</i></strong> energy, explore fractured realms and overcome monstrous guardians in a world lost to time and reality.  <br> <br><strong>Core Genre Tags:</strong> Metroidvania \u2022 2.5D Action Platformer \u2022 Dark Fantasy</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blight as a Weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Fuel your attacks and abilities with blight, a volatile force that grows stronger and more unstable the deeper you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality-Bending Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Traverse ruptures in time where environments shift and mutate as your corruption deepens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock the Past</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Discover relics, whispers, and corrupted memories scattered across ruins frozen in collapsing timelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Realms</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Journey through frozen wastelands, fungal tombs, and ancient sanctuaries lost beyond time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monstrous Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Face brutal enemies like the Mountain Fist Golem in high-speed, precision-driven battles.    <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/5324b140722a7f917edb196eab7177d5.poster.avif?t=1755093553\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/5324b140722a7f917edb196eab7177d5.webm?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/5324b140722a7f917edb196eab7177d5.mp4?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/d7c41ec6e5ba00be045f7e8729fa54a3.poster.avif?t=1755093553\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/d7c41ec6e5ba00be045f7e8729fa54a3.webm?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/d7c41ec6e5ba00be045f7e8729fa54a3.mp4?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/70311ef30d172bd9ff1f2d20c1472665.poster.avif?t=1755093553\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/70311ef30d172bd9ff1f2d20c1472665.webm?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/70311ef30d172bd9ff1f2d20c1472665.mp4?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/708e0590dba3a98764caa347be84f0e5.poster.avif?t=1755093553\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/708e0590dba3a98764caa347be84f0e5.webm?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/708e0590dba3a98764caa347be84f0e5.mp4?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Blightened</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the corruption when the cycle begins! Blight is both your weapon and your curse. Wield unstable <strong><i>blight</i></strong> energy, explore fractured realms and overcome monstrous guardians in a world lost to time and reality.  <br> <br><strong>Core Genre Tags:</strong> Metroidvania \u2022 2.5D Action Platformer \u2022 Dark Fantasy</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blight as a Weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Fuel your attacks and abilities with blight, a volatile force that grows stronger and more unstable the deeper you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality-Bending Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Traverse ruptures in time where environments shift and mutate as your corruption deepens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock the Past</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Discover relics, whispers, and corrupted memories scattered across ruins frozen in collapsing timelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Realms</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Journey through frozen wastelands, fungal tombs, and ancient sanctuaries lost beyond time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monstrous Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Face brutal enemies like the Mountain Fist Golem in high-speed, precision-driven battles.    <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/5324b140722a7f917edb196eab7177d5.poster.avif?t=1755093553\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/5324b140722a7f917edb196eab7177d5.webm?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/5324b140722a7f917edb196eab7177d5.mp4?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/d7c41ec6e5ba00be045f7e8729fa54a3.poster.avif?t=1755093553\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/d7c41ec6e5ba00be045f7e8729fa54a3.webm?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/d7c41ec6e5ba00be045f7e8729fa54a3.mp4?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/70311ef30d172bd9ff1f2d20c1472665.poster.avif?t=1755093553\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/70311ef30d172bd9ff1f2d20c1472665.webm?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/70311ef30d172bd9ff1f2d20c1472665.mp4?t=1755093553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/708e0590dba3a98764caa347be84f0e5.poster.avif?t=1755093553\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/708e0590dba3a987